            "summary": "If reviewPR returns { skipped: true, reason: 'pillar_disabled' }, the finalizer's new branch tests reason === 'not_activated' (false), the !reviewResult branch tests falsiness (false, object is truthy), the blocked branch tests .blocked (undefined), and execution reaches the else(success) branch reading reviewResult.verdict → undefined, rendering a false success check."
